p class=\"font-bold text-gray-800\">4.9★</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n             <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mt-2 mb-4\">\n                Creating beautiful, accessible digital experiences. Passionate about CSS, JavaScript, and user-centered design.\n            </p>\n            \n             <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 my-4\">\n                <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 text-xs rounded-full\">Tailwind CSS</span>\n                <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 text-xs rounded-full\">React</span>\n                <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-green-100 text-green-800 text-xs rounded-full\">Figma</span>\n                <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800 text-xs rounded-full\">JavaScript</span>\n            </div>\n            \n             <div class=\"flex gap-3 justify-center mt-6\">\n                <button class=\"px-6 py-2 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-purple-700 transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 focus:ring-opacity-50\">\n                    Follow\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"px-6 py-2 border border-purple-600 text-purple-600 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-purple-50 transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 focus:ring-opacity-50\">\n                    Message\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            \n             <div class=\"flex justify-center gap-4 mt-6 text-gray-500\">\n                <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Twitter profile\" class=\"hover:text-purple-600 transition-colors\">\n                    <i class=\"fab fa-twitter text-xl\"></i>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"GitHub profile\" class=\"hover:text-purple-600 transition-colors\">\n                    <i class=\"fab fa-github text-xl\"></i>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn profile\" class=\"hover:text-purple-600 transition-colors\">\n                    <i class=\"fab fa-linkedin-in text-xl\"></i>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Dribbble profile\" class=\"hover:text-purple-600 transition-colors\">\n                    <i class=\"fab fa-dribbble text-xl\"></i>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
